  "description": "Ultra-high-performance, zero-allocation, hardware-accelerated .NET Erasure Coding Engine engineered for enterprise object stores, distributed filesystems, and NVMe-oF storage appliances. Supports 10 algorithm families (Cauchy & Vandermonde Reed-Solomon, Azure & Pyramid LRC, RAID-5/RDP/EVENODD/Liberation XOR array codes, and MSR/MBR Regenerating codes) with AVX-512BW, AVX2, SSSE3, ARM64 NEON, and Scalar backends, self-healing CRC32-C bit-rot scrubbing, throttled repair orchestration, and OpenTelemetry observability.",
